			<div class="content" id="post-content-3858063">
									

<p>Big thanks to everyone who read over this in chat!</p>
<ul>
<li>Modern_Erasmus</li>
<li>sepjkl (refused koala)</li>
<li>Prototype_Toaster</li>
<li>mlister</li>
<li>Clout</li>
<li>subtletea</li>
<li>not_a_seagull</li>
<li>Rimple</li>
<li>ResearcherBlasko</li>
<li>salvagebar (accepted koala)</li>
</ul>
<p>So, this is another weird idea of mine that came partially from a chat conversation. The discussion started by people finding synonyms for the phrase &quot;trash panda&quot;:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>famine garbage bear.<br />
famine refuse koala<br />
Zyn &gt; 14:32 famine refuse koala<br />
Zyn I envisioned a sign that has like<br />
Zyn a shady-looking koala offering candy to a kid<br />
Zyn and the kid is holding up their hand like &quot;no&quot;<br />
Zyn and the sign is captioned &quot;Refuse Koala&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>And then I wanted to write this into a short Series-I-esque article. And here we are. Did you know that koalas are pretty weird and sometimes terrible animals? Although that said, I think they're cute from a distance&#8230;</p>
<p>Refuse koala.</p>

